      "authentication": "ContentStackHost implements UnauthenticatedAPIHost. FirmwareRequest uses the default empty injectionSites list. Although FirmwareRepository receives AuthHTTPClient, BaseHttpWrapper resolves this request to ContentStackHost and IRobotHttpManager only SigV4-signs AuthenticatedAPIHost requests; therefore the production firmware fetch is not account-signed.",
